{"id":"salud","lemma":"salud","pos":"intj","rank":669,"glosses":["bless you (said to somebody who has sneezed)","cheers (the usual toast when drinking alcohol)"],"ipa":"/saˈlud/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a3/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-salud.wav","examples":[{"text":"Fumar es terrible para tu salud.","en":"Smoking is terrible for your health.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/931415","words":[{"g":"to smoke"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"terrible"},{"g":"for"},{"g":"your"},null]},{"text":"Ella se preocupa por mi salud.","en":"She worries about my health.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/641702","words":[{"g":"she"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to worry","l":"preocupar"},{"g":"for / by"},{"g":"my"},null]},{"text":"Él parecía preocupado por su salud.","en":"He seemed worried about his health.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/37322","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to seem, to see fit","l":"parecer"},{"g":"worried, concerned"},{"g":"for / by"},{"g":"his / her / your"},null]},{"text":"Correr es bueno para la salud.","en":"Running is good for your health.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/645202","words":[{"g":"to run, to jog"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"good"},{"g":"for"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"¿Cómo estás de salud?","en":"How's your health?","words":[null,null,{"g":"of / from"},null],"phrases":[[0,2,"how are you?"]]}]}